RBS 1
# The built-in RIAPP demo (app/core/riapp_core.c) as a song: our own
# material. Compile: rbsc songs/demo/riapp-demo.rbs songs/demo/riapp-demo.rbng
TEMPO 140
CPRG ReIncarnation demo song, own material (CC0)
# 303A: the drive line (accents on the beats, a breath at the end)
P303 0 1 36a 36 39 36 41a 39 36 39 36a 36 39 36 42 41 39 -
# 808 floor: kick on the beat, closed hats on the off-beats, snare backbeat
PDRUM 2 1 BD x...x...x...x...
PDRUM 2 1 CH ..x...x...x...x.
PDRUM 2 1 SD ....x.......x...
PACC 2 1 x.......x.......
# 909 colour: crash on the one, rim + clap on the backbeat, toms, open hats
PDRUM 3 1 CC X...............
PDRUM 3 1 RS ....X.......X...
PDRUM 3 1 CP ....X.......X...
PDRUM 3 1 LT ......x.........
PDRUM 3 1 OH .......x.......x
PDRUM 3 1 MT ..........x.....
PDRUM 3 1 HT ..............x.
PACC 3 1 x...x.......x...
# 909 without the crash for the following bars
PDRUM 3 2 RS ....X.......X...
PDRUM 3 2 CP ....X.......X...
PDRUM 3 2 LT ......x.........
PDRUM 3 2 OH .......x.......x
PDRUM 3 2 MT ..........x.....
PDRUM 3 2 HT ..............x.
PACC 3 2 ....x.......x...
# Levi: Bm - G - D - A quarter triads
PLEVI 1 16 0 59,62,66
PLEVI 1 16 4 55,59,62
PLEVI 1 16 8 62,66,69
PLEVI 1 16 12 57,61,64
# Arrangement: 2 bars 303 + 808, then 909, then the Levi; 16 bars
TRACK 0 1 1 0 1 0 0
TRACK 2 3 1 0 1 1 0
TRACK 4 7 1 0 1 2 1
TRACK 8 8 1 0 1 1 1
TRACK 9 15 1 0 1 2 1
# Mix (the app's demo levels)
SET 0 mix-303a.Level 72
SET 0 mix-909.Level 62
SET 0 mix-808.Level 96
SET 0 mix-levi.Level 90
SET 0 levi.Patch_Level 14
SET 0 master.Level 120
